<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ Bank cuts NZ rural, small business rates.</title>
<headline>ANZ Bank cuts NZ rural, small business rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Bank on Friday said it had cut its variable rural lending rates in New Zealand to 11.4 percent from 12.0 percent.</p>
<p>It said it had also cut its small business lending rate to 11.75 percent from 12.0 percent and the commercial property rate to 11.25 percent from 12.0 percent.</p>
<p>The reduced rates take effect from Monday for new business and December 5 for existing businesses.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
